# pic/ is a local figure-style research corpus (~149 MB, mostly a gallery of
# third-party CC-BY paper figures). The user asked for the skill to be installed
# without committing the corpus. Ignored so `git add -A` cannot sweep it in
# again: that is exactly how it ended up in an unpushed local commit once.
pic/
